## Pi

- Prefer Pi-native subagents over launching other CLIs from inside Pi.
- `pi-kit` lanes need a full model selector and an effort per call. Read `lanes_models` for current selectors, effort limits, and task fit.
- When opening Plannotator or a grill review, include the `plannotator-url` output so another device can open it.
